---
type Props = {
  toolName: string;
  inputSummary: string;
  generatedBy: string;
  promptVersion: string;
  toolHref: string;
};
const { toolName, inputSummary, generatedBy, promptVersion, toolHref } =
  Astro.props;
---

<aside class="not-prose my-6 rounded-lg border border-border bg-muted/40 p-4 text-sm">
  <p class="font-medium">
    本文由 <a class="text-accent underline decoration-dashed" href={toolHref}>{toolName}</a> 生成
  </p>
  <ul class="mt-2 list-disc ps-5 text-muted-foreground">
    <li>输入：{inputSummary}（演示样例，非真实业务数据）</li>
    <li>生成：{generatedBy} · 提示词版本 v{promptVersion}</li>
    <li>
      输出中的【依据输入】【行业常识】【推断】标注与“待验证”声明均为工具内置的证据链规则，未作人工删改
    </li>
  </ul>
</aside>
